      "body": "Parshav Vatika LLP, K8 Products LLP and Tidagela Ventures Private Limited entered into a Share Purchase Agreement to acquire 67.17% stake in Lykis Limited (BSE:530689) from Nadir Dhrolia for approximately INR 250 million on December 18, 2025. Under the terms of the acquisition, Parshav Vatika LLP, K8 Products LLP and Tidagela Ventures Private Limited will acquire 13.01 million ordinary shares in Lykis Limited at INR 19.01 in cash per share. In a related transaction, Parshav Vatika LLP proposed to acquire 26% stake in Lykis Limited in an open offer transaction.\r\n\r\nThe transaction is subject to satisfaction of conditions precedent in the SPA and receipt of the statutory approvals.",
